R0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-g1DjLomPP61rDfMef4biVbw0lK9a4WXFTaxnqy8GxWw&oe=6A3EAE0D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_landscape_2560x1440_32bit.png", "id": "458129080179631", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/428937943_458129083512964_6569944225846957464_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R3G6Wa5cVhUQ7kNvwHmTZfg&_nc_oc=AdrxFUThhhjYbE8W1rMpdF4V8S5iBPwf7TKZ6EoIlnqZZYEMSb63sErkXVnA81mLKQo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af98ST9CkyCUs7jeg6aSPzOLNVYm0-IMg8p-ujqZwRMqQA&oe=6A3E8717"}, "display_name": "Bounce Arcade", "keywords": ["pinball", "arcade", "bounce", "velan"], "long_description": "Enter the machine and play pinball like you've never seen before in Bounce Arcade!\n\nWield your hands as paddles, guiding the ball through a series of immersive pinball worlds, each with their own challenges and surprises.\n\nNostalgic and frantic elements of classic pinball join all-new skills for a fast-paced arcade experience. Use a tractor beam to attract the ball back to you, and use a controllable lasso to nudge the ball where you want it to go for the ultimate skill shots (if you can master them).\n\nEach world brings its own unique mini-games to the table. In a dusty western town, your paddles transform into pistols for a shooting gallery. In a futuristic space station, use the ball to break up asteroids that enter the docking bay.\n\nExperience chaotic pinball action, flipped inside out!", "short_description": "Bounce Arcade is pinball blasted into the future!\n\nEnter the machine and play pinball like you've never seen before! Play through multiple thrilling tables, strive to survive, unlock mini-games, and chase high scores in next-level action gameplay.\n\nBounce Arcade mixes pinball classics like multiball with new mechanics like lassos and mini-games only possible in VR. Enter the zone and keep the ball alive!"}]}, "d